    "show_share": true,
    "description": "On August 20, the AKU Network of Teaching and Learning (TL_net) held its first Scholarship of Teaching & Learning Inaugural Conference titled, Engaged Teaching for Engaged Learning.  Over 150 faculty in Karachi, Dar es Salaam, London and Nairobi took part both in person and virtually.",
